WEBVTT

00:03.620 --> 00:05.260
[BERTHOLDT]
Heads up. She's back.

00:05.290 --> 00:06.920
Good.

00:09.290 --> 00:10.930
[REINER grunts]

00:23.740 --> 00:26.140
Oh, no!

00:26.180 --> 00:29.910
[ARMIN] No! They're
getting away with Eren!

00:36.490 --> 00:38.290
[Grunts]

00:38.320 --> 00:41.460
Ride! Let the Titans chase you!

00:41.490 --> 00:44.330
All squads, follow my lead!

00:44.360 --> 00:48.030
Do what? Erwin,
you conniving bastard!

00:48.100 --> 00:50.400
You're using us as bait again?

00:50.440 --> 00:52.170
It's the only way!

00:52.200 --> 00:57.540
You've fought well as MP's.
Now give your all as soldiers!

00:57.610 --> 01:00.940
The Armored Titan must
be stopped before he takes Eren.

01:00.980 --> 01:03.650
Failure is not an option!

01:05.550 --> 01:10.550
♪ Opening Song ♪

02:46.200 --> 02:49.340
Reiner's too slow!
We've got him!

02:49.370 --> 02:51.540
I won't hesitate this time.

02:51.570 --> 02:53.870
I'll kill them
without a thought.

02:53.910 --> 02:56.340
If Ymir feels
like getting in the way,

02:56.380 --> 02:58.580
so much the worse for her.

02:58.680 --> 03:03.080
This ends here and now.
I swear it!

03:13.800 --> 03:16.900
[Coughing]

03:16.930 --> 03:18.660
[BERTHOLDT]
Christa!

03:24.570 --> 03:25.910
[CHRISTA gasps]

03:25.940 --> 03:27.870
Ymir.

03:34.950 --> 03:36.420
Ymir!

03:36.450 --> 03:40.390
[Coughs]

03:40.420 --> 03:41.450
Christa--

03:41.560 --> 03:42.720
[Coughing]

03:42.760 --> 03:50.260
No--Historia,
I'm sorry about eating you.

03:50.300 --> 03:53.330
You're uh, probably pissed.

03:53.400 --> 03:54.770
[Coughs]

03:54.800 --> 03:57.970
Wha-What is this? I--

03:58.010 --> 04:00.340
What's going on? Talk to me!

04:00.410 --> 04:01.770
We came to rescue you and Er--

04:01.810 --> 04:03.680
Just shut up!

04:03.750 --> 04:07.180
I don't need rescuing.
Things have changed.

04:07.250 --> 04:09.880
I'm with Reiner
and Bertholdt now.

04:09.950 --> 04:12.690
Like it or not,
you're coming with us.

04:12.750 --> 04:16.160
There's no future
inside the walls.

04:16.190 --> 04:18.520
[Panting]

04:18.590 --> 04:21.660
Here me out
for a second, okay?

04:21.700 --> 04:25.530
Life outside isn't as bad
as you think, believe me.

04:25.600 --> 04:28.600
For starters, there's no one
saying the world woulda be

04:28.640 --> 04:32.940
a better place
if you'd never been born.

04:32.970 --> 04:36.140
Yeah, I don't think Titans
would say much either way.

04:36.180 --> 04:39.010
They'd be too busy
trying to devour me!

04:39.050 --> 04:40.380
We've all got flaws!

04:40.450 --> 04:42.350
They're not so bad if
you'd just give 'em a break!

04:42.380 --> 04:45.150
It's complicated, all right?
Get off your high horse!

04:45.190 --> 04:47.690
Ymir! I don't know what's
going on in your mind,

04:47.720 --> 04:51.160
but you're not making
any sense! Come on!

04:51.190 --> 04:53.190
What did Reiner
and Bertholdt say?

04:53.230 --> 04:54.690
You're doing this
against your will,

04:54.730 --> 04:56.800
they threatened you!

05:02.500 --> 05:05.540
It's the opposite, actually.

05:05.570 --> 05:08.040
I'm right, aren't I? Let go!

05:08.080 --> 05:10.240
Whatever they've got
on you, I don't care!

05:10.310 --> 05:12.250
We can fight them!

05:12.310 --> 05:14.180
Put the past behind you!

05:14.220 --> 05:16.380
What matters is right now!

05:16.480 --> 05:20.320
I'm here! I will
always be your ally!

05:26.590 --> 05:28.930
[BERTHOLDT]
Ymir!

05:29.000 --> 05:31.760
Look. In case you
haven't noticed,

05:31.830 --> 05:33.770
the Scouts are closing in.

05:33.840 --> 05:36.070
If we'd left earlier,
there might've been

05:36.170 --> 05:38.600
a decent chance
of outrunning them.

05:38.670 --> 05:40.940
Going back for Christa
was your idea.

05:41.010 --> 05:44.740
You forced us. Remember that.

05:44.780 --> 05:48.550
We waited.
For what? Damn it, Ymir!

05:48.580 --> 05:50.780
What the hell
did we do this for?

05:50.850 --> 05:53.220
You can't have
a change of heart!

05:53.250 --> 05:55.390
You want her
to rot inside the walls?

05:55.420 --> 05:58.120
Does that seem
acceptable to you now?

05:58.190 --> 06:00.760
Don't be a fool! Think!

06:00.800 --> 06:03.760
Let go! Don't listen to him!

06:03.800 --> 06:05.830
I can't!

06:12.240 --> 06:14.870
I wish I could.

06:14.910 --> 06:16.910
I'm sorry, sweetie.

06:16.950 --> 06:20.050
I know you think
I did this for you.

06:20.080 --> 06:23.680
But at the end of the day,
I did it for me.

06:27.260 --> 06:30.290
A long time ago I stole
the Power of the Titans

06:30.330 --> 06:32.590
from one of their comrades.

06:32.630 --> 06:34.630
Not much I can do against them.

06:34.660 --> 06:38.000
Sooner or later, I'm screwed.

06:38.070 --> 06:42.900
But, they said if
I cooperate, hand you over,

06:42.940 --> 06:45.570
maybe I've got
a shot at leniency.

06:45.640 --> 06:48.410
Maybe my crime gets overlooked.

06:48.440 --> 06:50.640
You're crucial to the Church.

06:50.680 --> 06:52.780
You know the truth
about the walls!

06:52.810 --> 06:54.510
[Gasps]

06:54.580 --> 06:58.450
[CHRISTA] My family?
That's it, isn't it?

06:58.490 --> 07:01.920
[YMIR]
Sure. Why not?

07:01.960 --> 07:04.790
[YMIR] When this world
started going to hell

07:04.830 --> 07:07.190
I thought to myself,
"couldn't hurt to have

07:07.260 --> 07:10.100
a bargaining chip
in my back pocket."

07:10.130 --> 07:13.830
The castle's as close
to death as I ever wanna get.

07:13.870 --> 07:16.300
Whole experience
traumatized me.

07:16.340 --> 07:18.140
Gave me perspective.

07:18.170 --> 07:20.510
If I have to play
dirty to stay alive,

07:20.540 --> 07:22.140
then I have to play dirty.

07:22.180 --> 07:26.180
Pathetic, yeah. Doesn't make
me the ideal friend.

07:26.210 --> 07:31.450
Like I said, though,
I didn't do this for you.

07:31.490 --> 07:34.320
You deserve better,
but there it is.

07:36.990 --> 07:39.960
I need you.

07:39.990 --> 07:42.800
Please save me, Historia!

07:50.040 --> 07:52.740
[CHRISTA]
Well, like I said.

07:52.810 --> 07:55.570
[Gasps]

07:55.640 --> 08:00.850
I'm here, and I will
always be your ally!

08:04.250 --> 08:06.750
[YMIR sobs]

08:17.900 --> 08:19.570
[grunts, yells]

08:30.280 --> 08:32.080
[MALE SOLDIER 36A screams]

08:34.250 --> 08:37.050
[Roars]

08:38.850 --> 08:40.220
[MIKASA grunts]

08:40.250 --> 08:42.860
Reiner! Protect us!

08:42.890 --> 08:44.720
[MIKASA grunts]

08:53.200 --> 08:55.400
[YMIR TITAN roars]

08:55.440 --> 08:59.140
[MIKASA] All right, then.
Looks like Ymir goes first!

08:59.210 --> 09:01.440
--[MIKASA bellows]
--[CHRISTA] Mikasa, no!

09:04.280 --> 09:05.980
You're not going to kill Ymir.

09:06.050 --> 09:09.580
That all depends on her.
What'll it be?

09:09.620 --> 09:12.280
She can step aside
or she can die. Her choice.

09:12.320 --> 09:14.490
That's not fair!
She'll die if she doesn't

09:14.560 --> 09:17.290
go along with what Reiner
and Bertholdt tell her to do.

09:17.330 --> 09:19.290
She's screwed either way!

09:19.330 --> 09:21.990
[Grunts] Listen,
there're only so many lives

09:22.060 --> 09:24.060
I can give a damn about.

09:24.100 --> 09:28.430
Cruel, but that's the world our
enemies gave us six years ago.

09:28.470 --> 09:30.770
Sorry. I don't have
any heartstrings left

09:30.810 --> 09:35.010
for you to tug on. If you
want compassion, move on.

09:35.080 --> 09:37.740
You want fair, tough shit.

09:37.780 --> 09:41.380
Time's wasting.
Pick your side, Christa.

09:41.420 --> 09:45.450
Eren? Or the bitch
I'm gonna kill?

09:45.490 --> 09:46.620
[Roars]

09:46.650 --> 09:48.390
[CHRISTA]
Ymir, stop!

09:48.460 --> 09:50.760
Look at her face! She means it!

09:50.790 --> 09:52.760
Don't make a move!

10:00.270 --> 10:02.670
[EREN grunts]

10:02.700 --> 10:05.970
Quit struggling!
It's not going to help!

10:06.010 --> 10:08.670
[JEAN] Good luck talking sense
into that one, Bertholdt.

10:08.710 --> 10:11.610
When something lights
a fire under him, that's it.

10:11.650 --> 10:14.110
Getting Eren to
calm down's a lost cause.

10:14.180 --> 10:15.980
Take my word for it.

10:16.020 --> 10:18.450
I've been on the receiving
end more than you have.

10:18.490 --> 10:21.320
What do you say
we teach him patience?

10:21.360 --> 10:23.620
Come on. Show yourself.

10:23.660 --> 10:25.720
Give him back! Right now!

10:25.790 --> 10:30.460
[CONNY] Guys, really? This is
some kind of joke, right?

10:30.500 --> 10:32.130
No way this is you.

10:32.170 --> 10:34.230
You've been lying
to us this whole time?

10:34.300 --> 10:36.140
We were supposed to be comrades!

10:36.170 --> 10:40.070
They still are! This is all
just a misunderstanding!

10:43.710 --> 10:45.380
[JEAN]
Where d'you think you're going?

10:45.410 --> 10:47.980
You can't keep running forever.

10:48.020 --> 10:51.380
We're not gonna let
that happen. Rat bastards.

10:51.420 --> 10:53.420
Through thick and thin
we slept under the same roof

10:53.490 --> 10:55.390
as soldiers for three years.

10:55.420 --> 10:58.160
Matter of fact, the
positions you could sleep in

10:58.190 --> 11:00.690
were an art from, Bertholdt.

11:00.730 --> 11:03.030
I'm not kidding.
We all loved waking up

11:03.060 --> 11:05.200
to see your contortions
in the morning.

11:05.230 --> 11:08.530
Used to predict
the weather with 'em.

11:08.570 --> 11:10.740
How'd you do it, Bertholdt?

11:10.770 --> 11:13.040
Must not've had
a care in the world.

11:13.070 --> 11:17.940
Lying beside your victims,
yet you slept like a log.

11:18.010 --> 11:20.550
Was it all just an act to you?

11:20.580 --> 11:22.110
What about the way
we used to talk about

11:22.180 --> 11:24.220
surviving this together?

11:24.250 --> 11:27.920
About growing old, looking back
on the worst of it over drinks.

11:28.020 --> 11:31.920
Remember? Was that all bullshit?

11:31.960 --> 11:33.860
Answer me!

11:33.900 --> 11:38.560
Go on. What was the point?
What were you trying to do?

11:38.600 --> 11:41.130
[MIKASA]
It doesn't matter anymore.

11:41.200 --> 11:44.870
Shut up and focus on
opening the traitor's neck.

11:44.910 --> 11:48.940
Hesitate for a moment
and we forfeit Eren.

11:48.980 --> 11:51.280
Who cares
what they pretended to be?

11:51.310 --> 11:53.410
This was their choice.

11:54.880 --> 11:56.920
No! You're wrong!

11:56.950 --> 12:01.190
Who chooses to be this? Tell me!

12:04.590 --> 12:07.930
What d'you think I am?
Huh? What?

12:07.960 --> 12:11.660
You think this is
what we aspired to be?

12:11.730 --> 12:15.170
People loathe us.
And why wouldn't they?

12:15.240 --> 12:16.900
We're monsters!

12:16.940 --> 12:21.810
We deserve to die
for the things we've done.

12:21.840 --> 12:24.780
We're lost. We could live
a thousand years

12:24.810 --> 12:27.410
and never again know peace.

12:27.450 --> 12:29.780
Try to imagine that darkness.

12:29.820 --> 12:33.290
The only light was
our brief time as soldiers.

12:33.320 --> 12:36.920
It was never a lie!
Do you understand?

12:36.960 --> 12:40.590
We're not who we said we were,
but it wasn't an act!

12:40.630 --> 12:45.000
We genuinely thought
of you as our friends!

12:45.030 --> 12:49.540
I'm not stupid. I know I have
no right to ask forgiveness,

12:49.600 --> 12:54.640
but please. I beg of you.

12:54.680 --> 13:00.850
If we were comrades,
someone find us.

13:05.720 --> 13:10.360
Give him back.
I won't ask again.

13:10.390 --> 13:13.160
I'm sorry. I can't.

13:13.190 --> 13:14.530
[MIKASA gasps]

13:14.560 --> 13:16.830
[BERTHOLDT]
One of you has to do it.

13:16.860 --> 13:21.670
One of you has to stain
your hands with my blood!

13:21.700 --> 13:26.310
[HANNES] Guys! Get down
from there and take cover!

13:26.340 --> 13:27.870
What the hell's Erwin doing?

13:27.910 --> 13:30.880
He's off his rocker! Look!

13:31.650 --> 13:33.110
The lunatic's leading
the Titans straight for us!

13:49.430 --> 13:51.290
[REINER TITAN growls lowly]

13:54.600 --> 13:58.070
Jump, damn you!
Get the hell out of there!

13:59.570 --> 14:03.640
Squadrons break!
Make the Titans scatter!

14:09.110 --> 14:10.910
[REINER TITAN grunts]

14:12.550 --> 14:13.750
[CHRISTA grunts]

14:13.780 --> 14:15.320
[BOTH groan]

14:22.660 --> 14:24.830
--[CHRISTA screams]
--[YMIR] Historia!

14:27.760 --> 14:33.530
[Roars]

14:33.600 --> 14:37.710
[JEAN]
What's going on? Is this hell?

14:39.380 --> 14:41.980
[ERWIN]
Not yet. But it will be.

14:42.010 --> 14:44.650
All soldiers charge!

14:44.680 --> 14:45.980
[CONNY]
Huh?

14:46.020 --> 14:48.280
[ERWIN] We've come
to the moment of truth!

14:48.320 --> 14:51.020
Mankind's fate is decided now!

14:51.090 --> 14:52.550
There is no future in which

14:52.620 --> 14:54.720
we reclaim these lands
without Eren--

14:54.790 --> 14:56.490
and there never will be!

14:56.530 --> 15:00.990
Go! Recover Eren from
the Armored Titan and retreat!

15:01.030 --> 15:04.360
Your heart and soul
to the cause!

15:05.170 --> 15:06.830
[CONNY]
Mikasa, wait!

15:10.140 --> 15:14.410
[SCOUTS yell]

15:14.480 --> 15:16.540
[MALE SOLDIER 33B]
This is madness.

15:16.580 --> 15:19.310
The Scouts have taken one
too many hits to the skull.

15:19.350 --> 15:21.080
--Look out!
--Huh?

15:21.150 --> 15:22.550
[MALE SOLDIER 33B screams]

15:27.090 --> 15:28.720
[EREN]
What's happening out there?

15:28.790 --> 15:31.290
Ugh! If only I could see!

15:34.760 --> 15:38.700
[REINER] I can't move. 'Less I
can shake these Titans,

15:38.730 --> 15:42.240
it'll only get worse.

15:42.270 --> 15:45.710
Okay, then.
Heads up, Bertholdt.

15:45.740 --> 15:47.840
Brace yourself!

15:47.880 --> 15:51.950
That's right.
Just a little more!

15:52.010 --> 15:54.880
It's working!
His hands are down!

15:54.920 --> 15:56.250
Now's our chance!

15:56.290 --> 15:59.250
Uh, Mikasa? You can see
those Titans, right?

15:59.360 --> 16:01.220
I mean, I get it, you're strong.

16:01.260 --> 16:03.060
But that's one hell of a mess.

16:03.090 --> 16:05.830
Slipping through
isn't gonna be easy.

16:05.900 --> 16:07.930
Advance!

16:09.130 --> 16:10.730
[MIKASA gasps]

16:11.870 --> 16:13.870
[ALL gasp]

16:13.900 --> 16:17.600
[MALE SOLDIER 36C]
Commander Erwin!

16:18.370 --> 16:21.810
I said advance, goddamn it!

16:21.880 --> 16:26.550
Eren's right in front
of you! Do not falter!

16:26.580 --> 16:28.220
[Gasps]

16:32.320 --> 16:34.250
[SCOUTS yell]

16:34.290 --> 16:35.890
[MALE SOLDIER 36D screams]

16:35.930 --> 16:38.460
[MALE SOLDIER 36E and 36F scream]

16:38.490 --> 16:41.900
--[MALE SOLDIER 36G screams]
--[MALE SOLDIER 36H yells]

16:41.930 --> 16:43.600
[MALE SOLDIER 36I screams]

16:43.630 --> 16:47.470
[ALL yell]

16:56.080 --> 16:57.950
[MIKASA grunts]

16:59.950 --> 17:04.250
[EREN yells muffled]

17:04.790 --> 17:06.420
[Screams]

17:06.460 --> 17:08.690
[JEAN]
Mikasa!

17:08.760 --> 17:12.630
You piece of shit!
Get your hands off her!

17:14.530 --> 17:18.470
[MALE SOLDIER 36K, 36L yell]

17:19.670 --> 17:22.040
We've come too far
to give up now.

17:22.100 --> 17:26.270
Wearegoing home.
And Eren is coming with us.

17:26.310 --> 17:29.110
[EREN]
No. This is all on me.

17:29.140 --> 17:32.050
People are dying
because I got caught!

17:32.110 --> 17:33.480
[ARMIN]
Bertholdt!

17:35.820 --> 17:38.250
[EREN]
Armin?

17:40.190 --> 17:42.660
[ARMIN]
That's the irony, really.

17:42.690 --> 17:45.990
If you can't let it go
it's not worth holding on to.

17:46.030 --> 17:48.630
[ERWIN]
Advance!

17:49.670 --> 17:54.330
[ARMIN] Think. What is it
I have to let go of?

17:54.370 --> 17:59.310
My life? Or something else?

18:00.480 --> 18:02.440
[Gasps]

18:17.890 --> 18:21.760
[ARMIN]
So, you're okay with this?

18:21.830 --> 18:25.200
Leaving your friend behind
to face the music?

18:25.230 --> 18:26.530
[BERTHOLDT gasps]

18:26.570 --> 18:28.370
[REINER gasps]

18:28.400 --> 18:31.170
I guess Annie
was weighing you down?

18:31.210 --> 18:33.010
D'you know where she is?

18:33.040 --> 18:38.380
Way up north in the Utopia
District. Being tortured.

18:38.410 --> 18:40.010
[grunts]

18:40.050 --> 18:43.050
[ARMIN] The silent treatment
only goes so far.

18:43.090 --> 18:47.250
The body may heal, but her
screams are an object lesson

18:47.320 --> 18:49.720
on the limits of endurance.

18:49.760 --> 18:52.190
Oh, don't worry,
they're taking special care

18:52.230 --> 18:55.700
she doesn't die...
or get a moment's rest.

18:55.730 --> 18:59.100
So many methods, so little time.

18:59.130 --> 19:01.800
Mustn't waste a
prize specimen like Annie.

19:01.870 --> 19:04.000
She's too precious.

19:04.040 --> 19:07.810
Shut your mouth, hell spawn!
I'll kill you!

19:07.880 --> 19:09.680
[ERWIN grunts]

19:10.910 --> 19:13.280
[Growls]

19:28.100 --> 19:31.430
[ERWIN]
All soldiers, retreat!

19:31.500 --> 19:34.430
[Roars]

19:36.810 --> 19:39.410
[Yells]

19:45.610 --> 19:47.480
[CHRISTA]
I did it.

19:47.520 --> 19:50.380
I actually killed one.
You all right?

19:50.420 --> 19:52.150
Get away from her!

19:54.360 --> 19:55.920
What the hell
were you trying to pull?

19:55.960 --> 19:57.320
We're leaving!

19:57.360 --> 19:59.160
Yeah, couldn't you go for
some grub right about now?

19:59.190 --> 20:02.000
You don't understand!
Let me down!

20:02.030 --> 20:03.060
Please!

20:03.100 --> 20:04.360
[BOTH]
Huh?

20:04.430 --> 20:06.170
Reiner and Bertholdt
are going to kill Ymir

20:06.200 --> 20:08.870
unless we both agree
to go back with them!

20:08.940 --> 20:11.810
She'll only be free
if she hands me over!

20:11.840 --> 20:16.440
I'd already decided
to let that happen.

20:16.480 --> 20:18.810
Are you nuts?
What if it's a trick?

20:18.850 --> 20:21.050
[CHRISTA]
It's not! Let me go!

20:21.120 --> 20:23.820
Conny's right!
Whatever she said, it's a lie!

20:23.850 --> 20:26.290
Don't listen to her!

20:26.320 --> 20:27.950
This doesn't make sense.

20:27.990 --> 20:29.460
Why would someone
who fought tooth and nail

20:29.490 --> 20:31.730
to save your life just
turn you over to the enemy?

20:31.790 --> 20:33.960
What's the end game?

20:36.400 --> 20:38.700
[CONNY] The only time Ymir
bothers to make an effort

20:38.730 --> 20:40.730
is when you're in danger.

20:40.800 --> 20:43.000
I don't know what kind
of trouble she's in,

20:43.040 --> 20:46.240
but for now just calm down
till we know more.

20:46.310 --> 20:49.210
[SASHA] Exactly. Either way,
we can't stick around.

20:49.280 --> 20:50.840
Whatever Ymir needs you for,
I'm sure you won't

20:50.880 --> 20:52.850
be much good to her dead!

